WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:03.862
The second thing missing was a way to
watch the decisions without a tenant.

2
00:00:03.862 --> 00:00:08.632
The offline mode takes saved waiting
records in the Table API's shape,

3
00:00:08.632 --> 00:00:11.812
saved reads keyed by
subject, and a fixed clock.

4
00:00:11.812 --> 00:00:16.237
The same function makes the same
decisions; only the reader is swapped.

5
00:00:16.237 --> 00:00:19.345
It's a dry run only: the
apply flag is refused,

6
00:00:19.345 --> 00:00:25.025
and a subject with no saved read is an
error, because a missing read isn't a match.

7
00:00:25.025 --> 00:00:28.418
Six fictional waiting
records cover every outcome,

8
00:00:28.418 --> 00:00:32.900
from a clean verify to the empty
intended state the guard exists for.
